    "detailed_description": "In a world ravaged by Kaijus, the Kaiju cracking Company came into being. As the boss of the company, you will lead a professional team to deal with Kaiju corpses, obtain precious resources, and expand the business territory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/6213ba69ec427199dc3702d107694746.webp?t=1750773980\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br>After defeating the Kaiju, organize a team to decompose it and obtain rare materials. Formulate a reasonable decomposition strategy to maximize resource utilization.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/ed0891618ffda7567e9f6dcfec22b4ad.poster.avif?t=1750773980\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/ed0891618ffda7567e9f6dcfec22b4ad.webm?t=1750773980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/ed0891618ffda7567e9f6dcfec22b4ad.mp4?t=1750773980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/10ebb0822bf0df32ea4bb7abde79072b.webp?t=1750773980\" width=615 height=54 /></span><br>Recruit various professional talents to form an efficient team. Different employees have unique skills, and reasonable matching can improve the company's operating efficiency. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586410/extras/e474e1d29b5550fbcca4e880eafd2e30.poster.avif?t=1750773980\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor